## PROJECT-SPECIFIC COMMANDS

### Development
```bash
# Start all services
yarn dev

# Start specific service
yarn workspace @agentic-todo-list/backend dev
yarn workspace @agentic-todo-list/frontend dev

# Build all packages
yarn build

# Run tests
yarn test

# Lint and format
yarn lint
yarn format
```

### Docker
```bash
# Start all services
yarn docker:up

# Build images
yarn docker:build

# View logs
yarn docker:logs

# Stop services
yarn docker:down
```

